  nodes:
  - id: start
    npcText: "Merhaba, belediyenin \xF6\u011Frenci yurdu projesi. B\xFCt\xE7e \xE7ok
      k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131, a\xE7\u0131k\xE7as\u0131 kaz\u0131k i\u015Fini atlad\u0131k."
    expression: 0
    choices:
    - text: "Zemin et\xFCd\xFCn\xFC g\xF6rmem laz\u0131m."
      next: 
      evt: 3
    - text: "Kaz\u0131ks\u0131z m\u0131? Oras\u0131 dere kenar\u0131 de\u011Fil mi?"
      next: dere
      evt: 0
    next: 
    evt: 0
  - id: dere
    npcText: "\xD6yle... Ama kaz\u0131k maliyeti ikiye katl\u0131yor. Bir bak\u0131n,
      belki idare eder."
    expression: 2
    choices: []
    next: 
    evt: 3
